    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 25.939999,
      "end": 34.84,
      "text": "This story was first published in Imagination Stories of Science and Fantasy, April 1951.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 36.98,
      "end": 40.539997,
      "text": "I got the bad news as soon as we landed on Mars.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 41.399998,
      "end": 46.6,
      "text": "The minute I got off the spacer, the little yellow Marty was standing there with the yellow envelope.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 47.26,
      "end": 49.66,
      "text": "He said, Gladiator Jack Dempsey.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 50.32,
      "end": 52.92,
      "text": "I admitted it, and he handed me the envelope.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 52.92,
      "end": 55.66,
      "text": "made me feel kind of good",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 55.66,
      "end": 57.48,
      "text": "as though I was somebody important",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 57.48,
      "end": 58.379997,
      "text": "which I'm not",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 58.379997,
      "end": 59.999996,
      "text": "I'd been taken",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 60,
      "end": 66.33999969999999,
      "text": "plenty of guff on the trip, not only from Susie, but from Alger Wild, who was also along.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 67.48,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "Yeah, between them, they'd ridden me as well as the liner, all the way from Terra.",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 73.299999,
      "end": 77.66,
      "text": "I handed the morty a copeck and put the yellow envelope in my pocket,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 78.06,
      "end": 82.039999,
      "text": "as though I was used to getting spacegrams. I said to Susie,",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 82.34,
      "end": 88.84,
      "text": "Let's hit the chow line. I don't usually talk that fancy, but I was trying to impress her with",
      "check": false
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 88.84,
      "end": 93.46000000000001,
      "text": "my knowledge of antique phrases. Both Susie and Alger Wilde are",
      "check": false
    }
